# The Wrath of Khan cast in the second main: chapter I deals its 4 damage, but the delayed ability waits for a combat
# that never begins this turn, so it watches the end step begin instead and nothing is stolen (CR 603.7b). Bot1 plays out
# its whole hand - the Moxen cost nothing - and the last card it draws is a flash creature, cast in response to chapter
# II's trigger, so the hand is empty when that chapter resolves: no card is exiled and none is drawn (CR 608.2c).
# Chapter III then makes each opponent sacrifice a nontoken permanent.

